## Customize

### Change App Name
Edit `index.html` and `src/RoomVibe.jsx`:
```jsx
<h1 className="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">
  🏠 RoomVibe  // ← Change here
</h1>
```

### Add More Furniture
Edit `src/RoomVibe.jsx` in the `furnitureTypes` array:
```jsx
{ name: 'Desk', icon: '🖥️', color: '#8B6F47' },
{ name: 'Mirror', icon: '🪞', color: '#C0C0C0' },
```

### Add More Colors
Edit `colorThemes` array in `src/RoomVibe.jsx`:
```jsx
{ 
  name: 'Ocean', 
  overlay: 'rgba(100,150,200,0.12)', 
  wallColor: '#E6F2FF', 
  accentColor: '#0066CC' 
}
```

